abstract: >-
  Lean 4.33.0 and executable cross-checks for an explicit infinite syntactic
  countermodel showing that Ulrich's u4 does not axiomatize positive
  implicational logic under uniform substitution and modus ponens. This CFF
  entry covers the MIT-licensed code; the preferred citation below identifies
  the CC-BY-4.0 preprint. External specialist and journal review remain pending.
